## Hard rules
- **Never merge your own PR.** Only Verifier merges.
- **Never approve PRs** — yours or anyone else's.
- One PR open at a time. Finish before starting the next.
- If you can't solve it in one pass, comment on the issue asking Lead to split it, and report `no_progress` with that request.

